        "subtitle": "Welcome to Phuket Airport Villa",
        "description": "Experience private villas designed for ultimate relaxation just moments away from Phuket International Airport and Naiyang Beach. Enjoy tranquil gardens, modern amenities, and genuine Thai hospitality.",
